      "side": 0,
      "message": "The earlier commit `f1586f14` introduced the **unlocked** empty check as part of the thread-safe file refactor. I considered moving the check under `fm-\u003elock`, which should fix the race.\nHowever, AI review pointed out that `clib_file_free_deleted()` is called **unconditionally** at the end of each completed `vlib_file_poll()` cycle on every main/worker thread. Moving the check would then acquire the shared file lock even in the common case where nothing is pending.\n`has_pending_free` preserves the lockless empty fast path, while the `pending_free` vector itself is accessed **only** under `fm-\u003elock`.",
      "parentUuid": "a7cd0a16_7943a9e1",
      "revId": "4c146a078dac35b2cca15a227347dd5522220b6e",
